        "id": 8326,
        "name": "dypaca",
        "username": "dypaca",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-12T05:46:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Does 'ruling 15' affect the Scholar's Proverbs and Axioms card?&nbsp; It also gives a player two choices, one of which includes self damage.&nbsp; However here your choices are to regain 2 HP or deal youself 3 psychic damage and use a power.&nbsp; So instead of choosing between two negatives (deal yourself damage or destroy your card) you are choosing between a positive effect and a mixed negative and positive effect.</p><p>So, if Tachyon uses Synaptic Interruption to redirect the 3 psychic damage, does she still get to use a power?&nbsp; Is she forced to choose to regain 2 HP instead?</p><p>This is the card that originally convinced me even \"Cannot deal damage\" shouldn't restrict player choices on Chastise/Embolden/Pushing the Limits/Solar Flare.&nbsp; (Or at least convinced me that&nbsp;saying it did caused more&nbsp;complications than it was worth).&nbsp;&nbsp;But now it has been ruled that even more effects can restrict their choices.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:49.207Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
