        "raw": "<p>Does &#39;ruling 15&#39; affect the Scholar&#39;s Proverbs and Axioms card?&nbsp; It also gives a player two choices, one of which includes self damage.&nbsp; However here your choices are to regain 2 HP or deal youself 3 psychic damage and use a power.&nbsp; So instead of choosing between two negatives (deal yourself damage or destroy your card) you are choosing between a positive effect and a mixed negative and positive effect.</p><p>So, if Tachyon uses Synaptic Interruption to redirect the 3 psychic damage, does she still get to use a power?&nbsp; Is she forced to choose to regain 2 HP instead?</p><p>This is the card that originally convinced me even &quot;Cannot deal damage&quot; shouldn&#39;t restrict player choices on Chastise/Embolden/Pushing the Limits/Solar Flare.&nbsp; (Or at least convinced me that&nbsp;saying it did caused more&nbsp;complications than it was worth).&nbsp;&nbsp;But now it has been ruled that even more effects can restrict their choices.</p>",
